{"duration": 48.803, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A young woman licks the tip of her paintbrush at work.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.333}, {"beat": 0, "text": "Then she dips it in glowing paint and paints a watch dial.", "start": 2.413, "end": 4.994}, {"beat": 0, "text": "She does this all day, every day.", "start": 5.074, "end": 6.757}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Her name is Grace Fryer. She paints watch faces for the army.", "start": 6.957, "end": 9.943}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Her boss tells her the paint is safe.", "start": 10.023, "end": 11.611}, {"beat": 1, "text": "She earns about a penny and a half per dial.", "start": 11.691, "end": 13.632}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Her teeth start to ache. Then they fall out.", "start": 13.832, "end": 16.077}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Her jaw breaks. Her bones snap.", "start": 16.157, "end": 17.821}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Doctors see women with loose teeth and ulcers that won't heal.", "start": 17.901, "end": 20.653}, {"beat": 3, "text": "The company says the women are showing signs of infection.", "start": 20.853, "end": 23.392}, {"beat": 3, "text": "They tell the women radium is safe.", "start": 23.472, "end": 25.061}, {"beat": 4, "text": "You see, it's like when you're told not to touch something hot.", "start": 25.261, "end": 27.71}, {"beat": 4, "text": "But everyone around you says it's fine.", "start": 27.79, "end": 29.497}, {"beat": 4, "text": "So you touch it. Again and again.", "start": 29.577, "end": 31.411}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The real reason is the paint.", "start": 31.611, "end": 33.08}, {"beat": 5, "text": "It's made from powdered radium, a radioactive metal.", "start": 33.16, "end": 35.665}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Radium shoots out tiny particles that break your bones from inside.", "start": 35.745, "end": 38.859}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The women swallowed it with every lick.", "start": 38.939, "end": 40.548}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The man who invented the paint died from it too.", "start": 40.748, "end": 42.903}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Radium was sold as a health cure for years.", "start": 42.983, "end": 44.998}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The same poison that killed them was advertised as medicine.", "start": 45.078, "end": 47.903}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.119, "end": 0.144, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "young", "start": 0.194, "end": 0.369, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "woman", "start": 0.419, "end": 0.719, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "licks", "start": 0.769, "end": 0.894, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "the", "start": 0.919, "end": 0.969, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "tip", "start": 1.019, "end": 1.119, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "of", "start": 1.144, "end": 1.194, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "her", "start": 1.219, "end": 1.294, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "paintbrush", "start": 1.344, "end": 1.694, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "at", "start": 1.744, "end": 1.794, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "work.", "start": 1.844, "end": 2.333, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Then", "start": 2.503, "end": 2.603, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "she", "start": 2.653, "end": 2.728, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dips", "start": 2.778, "end": 2.928, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "it", "start": 2.953, "end": 3.003, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 3.053, "end": 3.103, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "glowing", "start": 3.153, "end": 3.403, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "paint", "start": 3.453, "end": 3.828, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "and", "start": 3.903, "end": 3.978, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "paints", "start": 4.003, "end": 4.178, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 4.203, "end": 4.228, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "watch", "start": 4.278, "end": 4.453, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dial.", "start": 4.478, "end": 4.994, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "She", "start": 5.164, "end": 5.239, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "does", "start": 5.264, "end": 5.364, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "this", "start": 5.389, "end": 5.489, "line": 2, "beat": 0}, {"w": "all", "sta